WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:05.420
Please look forward to it.

00:06.470 --> 00:08.680
Madanbashi Kouichi?!

00:18.770 --> 00:20.810
All right!

00:20.810 --> 00:22.230
Perfect!

00:22.980 --> 00:25.530
Ouch! What speed and power!

00:26.150 --> 00:27.190
Madanbashi!

00:27.190 --> 00:28.700
Kouichi-kun?

00:28.700 --> 00:30.410
The brat of Eros lives!

00:30.820 --> 00:32.570
But, that candle...

00:33.700 --> 00:35.990
Candle... could it be?!

00:40.250 --> 00:43.130
As I thought, you were alive, Kouichi-kun!

00:43.840 --> 00:45.000
Kyouko.

00:46.090 --> 00:48.840
I heard your voice.

00:49.260 --> 00:52.800
So that's why you rushed to
me dressed so erotically.

00:53.550 --> 00:54.890
That's not it at all!

00:54.890 --> 00:56.430
Let's talk later!

00:57.770 --> 01:00.020
We're going to take down Rikantz Seaberry.

01:00.060 --> 01:05.400
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

01:05.020 --> 01:10.950
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

01:18.370 --> 01:24.040
The darkness is spreading

01:23.710 --> 01:29.460
Why do I keep fighting?

01:29.010 --> 01:39.980
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

01:39.680 --> 01:45.480
The sound of moaning gives me power

01:44.940 --> 01:48.070
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

01:52.950 --> 01:58.700
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

01:58.410 --> 02:04.120
Attack when fully charged

02:30.280 --> 02:35.070
Episode 11 :

02:30.280 --> 02:35.070
Distraction !The Emperor's Sexual Harassment

02:32.490 --> 02:34.910
Wh-What in the world are you doing?!

02:34.910 --> 02:37.780
Just leave everything to me!

02:42.790 --> 02:46.170
Finger Beam!

02:47.460 --> 02:48.290
Kouichi!

02:48.460 --> 02:50.800
So! You were alive!

02:55.590 --> 02:59.970
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

03:00.310 --> 03:02.560
No! He's weaker in terms of physical strength!

03:03.350 --> 03:04.310
Kyouko!

03:04.850 --> 03:05.850
What?

03:05.850 --> 03:06.940
Let's do this!

03:08.360 --> 03:10.570
So it comes to this, after all.

03:10.570 --> 03:12.860
Even though this is supposed
to be our tear-jerking reunion.

03:13.650 --> 03:16.910
Wh-What? When was this installed...?

03:16.910 --> 03:20.160
I asked them to
revamp it on the other side!

03:20.160 --> 03:22.910
I was thinking of you, Kyouko!

03:23.620 --> 03:25.910
Hey! D-Don't be so rough!

03:26.670 --> 03:29.580
Woah! Such a great response, as usual!

03:29.580 --> 03:31.670
Why are you always like this?!

03:31.670 --> 03:33.590
Hey, now! Don't take my clothes off!

03:33.590 --> 03:35.090
It's fine! It's fine!

03:35.090 --> 03:36.720
I'm not wearing anything underneath!

03:37.970 --> 03:39.640
S-Stop...

03:39.640 --> 03:41.680
All right! Here it comes!

03:41.680 --> 03:43.680
Idiot!

03:44.890 --> 03:47.940
Hi-ERO particles full burst!

03:48.310 --> 03:50.360
This power...

03:50.360 --> 03:52.730
This is more than twenty
times the power of the Type-2!

03:52.730 --> 03:54.780
No, even more than that!

03:55.240 --> 03:56.030
Jesus!

04:02.950 --> 04:03.990
What?!

04:04.580 --> 04:06.000
The Evolt...

04:09.540 --> 04:10.790
I did it!

04:18.880 --> 04:19.680
What is that?

04:19.930 --> 04:21.680
Looks like Hi-ERO particles.

04:21.680 --> 04:23.890
Jeez, he's just scattering them everywhere.

04:23.890 --> 04:26.060
What a waste.

04:26.680 --> 04:29.310
No! We must recover Ritz!

04:29.310 --> 04:30.140
Let's go!

04:31.150 --> 04:33.650
I-Is it okay for me to go?

04:33.940 --> 04:35.940
Don't say such things, brother.

04:35.940 --> 04:39.490
You're already a part of
the Penguin Empire family!

04:47.290 --> 04:49.920
Why? Why?

05:01.430 --> 05:02.890
Shouma-kun.

05:04.430 --> 05:05.680
Good job.

05:12.060 --> 05:16.150
Daimidaler, Super Thermal Power
System Mounted Type, Kouichi.

05:16.650 --> 05:18.900
That's this robot's name?

05:19.240 --> 05:22.910
I call it Type-Super for short.
Isn't its power amazing?

05:23.450 --> 05:28.410
So a mysterious thermal
power system moves this robot.

05:28.700 --> 05:33.380
And then Kouichi uses all his
Hi-ERO particles in his attacks.

05:33.380 --> 05:38.170
I see, so the last emission was the
release of unused Hi-ERO particles.

05:38.170 --> 05:39.710
I don't understand at all.

05:39.710 --> 05:42.260
What the hell, Master? You don't get it?

05:42.510 --> 05:45.550
In other words, Type-Super
has two different energy sources...

05:45.550 --> 05:51.770
What I don't understand is where this robot was modified, if not at Beauty Salon Prince.

05:53.770 --> 05:55.560
After that explosion...

05:57.190 --> 06:01.530
When I woke up, I was in
some weird place with Daimidaler.

06:01.530 --> 06:02.990
Weird place?

06:02.990 --> 06:03.740
Yeah.

06:04.160 --> 06:07.490
On top of that,
I couldn't contact anyone at all.

06:07.490 --> 06:12.580
I wandered around aimlessly for a
bit and was picked up by some group.

06:12.580 --> 06:14.830
Those guys also worked on robots,

06:14.830 --> 06:17.920
so they made some modifications when they fixed up Type-2.

06:18.550 --> 06:21.380
They took care of me for a while.

06:21.380 --> 06:22.550
What did you say?!

06:22.550 --> 06:25.090
You allowed another group to
touch Daimidaler?! Are you serious?!

06:25.090 --> 06:26.550
It couldn't be helped!

06:26.800 --> 06:29.470
So? What kind of group was it?

06:29.470 --> 06:31.060
Or was it some kind
of corporate enterprise?

06:31.430 --> 06:33.060
Oh, well.

06:33.850 --> 06:36.810
Huh? Huh?

06:37.360 --> 06:38.520
What's wrong?

06:39.070 --> 06:41.070
I can't remember at all!

06:41.070 --> 06:43.820
I even forgot the faces of
the people who took care of me!

06:43.820 --> 06:46.910
Are you serious about
giving us a report or not?

06:48.030 --> 06:50.410
I was told that I could
get back to this world

06:50.410 --> 06:54.120
if Daimidaler's left arm was still intact.

06:54.120 --> 06:56.080
I spent all my free time in the cockpit,

06:56.080 --> 06:59.090
thinking of Kyouko and home.

06:59.090 --> 07:02.260
So Sonan-chan picked up on those feelings.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.220
Thinking about me...

07:04.470 --> 07:07.510
So he was thinking of Sonan-chan's body.

07:08.050 --> 07:09.180
Hey, now.

07:09.180 --> 07:10.350
Kiyuna-chan!

07:11.140 --> 07:13.480
You have to lie down a little longer.

07:14.180 --> 07:17.980
Are you Madanbashi Kouichi-kun?

07:19.190 --> 07:20.570
Could it be,

07:21.230 --> 07:22.280
you're braless?!

07:22.280 --> 07:25.030
What?! Who cares about such things!

07:25.030 --> 07:27.740
This is Kiyuna Kiriko-chan.

07:27.740 --> 07:31.030
She's a more experienced Daimidaler pilot than you.

07:31.030 --> 07:31.790
Huh?

07:32.830 --> 07:35.080
Oh, the Gakuran Idiot.

07:35.080 --> 07:37.710
I forgot to mention it, but you
two are from the same school.

07:37.710 --> 07:38.580
Huh?!

07:39.670 --> 07:42.670
Kiriko-chan is a third year
and Kouichi-kun is a second year,

07:42.670 --> 07:44.800
so Kiriko-chan is your
senior in that sense, too.

07:44.800 --> 07:48.220
Oh, that's right
Kiyuna-chan. About the Type-6...

07:48.220 --> 07:48.840
Yes?

07:49.220 --> 07:52.930
The damage was all exterior
and it seems the frame is still intact.

07:52.930 --> 07:56.350
We just need to install some new parts,
and you'll be able to sortie again.

07:56.350 --> 07:59.350
I see. Thank goodness.

08:00.940 --> 08:04.610
The time to settle things
with the Penguin Empire is near.

08:04.980 --> 08:08.320
The powered up Type-2, no, Type-Super...

08:08.320 --> 08:12.620
We'll challenge them while
we still have the upper hand.

08:13.080 --> 08:16.370
When you put it that way, it sounds cowardly.

08:16.370 --> 08:18.370
Yeah! Leave it to me!

08:18.370 --> 08:22.500
My hands are itching
to touch Kyouko's body!

08:22.500 --> 08:24.090
No! Jeez!

08:24.090 --> 08:25.260
Wait! Kyouko!

08:25.260 --> 08:26.880
No! Something like this!

08:26.880 --> 08:32.350
I'll definitely get Shouma-kun back from the Penguin Empire!

08:29.130 --> 08:30.760
Let me fondle them!

08:32.350 --> 08:35.180
Wow, this is a really nice place.

08:36.140 --> 08:37.520
Do you like it here?

08:37.520 --> 08:39.100
Nice to meet you, brother.

08:39.100 --> 08:40.980
Let's play Old Maid later!

08:40.980 --> 08:44.610
Welcome to your new family, Shouma.

08:44.980 --> 08:46.610
Penguin transfer!

08:46.610 --> 08:50.780
Your Highness, you shouldn't
call for a transfer in the bath.

08:50.780 --> 08:54.120
The candle that suddenly
appeared on Daimidaler.

08:55.290 --> 08:58.000
It was definitely using the
Super Thermal Power System.

08:58.460 --> 09:02.790
That's the limitless power system
that the humans in the other world created.

09:03.460 --> 09:04.840
What?

09:04.840 --> 09:08.760
So Kouichi was in the
same world as Master Humboldt?

09:09.220 --> 09:13.180
The Penguin Device uses a
huge amount of Hi-ERO particles

09:13.180 --> 09:15.760
in order to perform a
transfer between dimensions.

09:16.350 --> 09:18.430
The Hi-ERO generator that went berserk

09:18.850 --> 09:21.600
functioned just like the Penguin device,

09:22.440 --> 09:25.570
sending Madanbashi
Kouichi to a parallel world.

09:26.480 --> 09:31.240
And this time, the strong Hi-ERO
particles from the Super Antarctic

09:31.240 --> 09:33.660
must have called him back to this world.

09:34.990 --> 09:40.460
That left arm was probably
used as a beacon for his transfer.

09:41.160 --> 09:45.340
We increased our power by
summoning the Super Antarctic,

09:45.340 --> 09:48.630
but it also revived a troublesome man.

09:49.920 --> 09:52.010
We don't understand complicated things,

09:52.010 --> 09:54.640
but we can finally
settle things with Kouichi!

09:55.510 --> 10:00.480
I heard that the young man named
Shouma released all his Hi-ERO particles

10:00.480 --> 10:03.140
and became a Penguin commando.

10:03.650 --> 10:07.440
And Henry, who was injected with
Hi-ERO particles, became a human.

10:07.860 --> 10:10.320
I wonder what this could mean.

10:10.940 --> 10:16.070
No, forget it. Even I am reaching my limit.

10:18.700 --> 10:20.540
Your Highness!

10:21.120 --> 10:22.250
Your Highness!

10:22.790 --> 10:24.920
It looks like I've reached my limit.

10:25.630 --> 10:27.290
Your Highness!

10:28.880 --> 10:30.380
He's overheated from the bath.

10:30.380 --> 10:33.970
Man, it's because he
talks so much while bathing.

10:34.760 --> 10:37.680
Someone get me some water!

10:41.980 --> 10:46.230
Daimidaler again? How troublesome.

10:46.230 --> 10:49.730
No, that's not the only thing
I'd like to show you this time.

10:50.400 --> 10:54.610
Wasn't the immoral adult corner removed?

10:55.490 --> 11:00.740
How terrible. At this rate,
sound boys will become corrupted.

11:00.740 --> 11:05.870
It looks like an area of the capital
suddenly became unhealthy one day.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.500
What is the meaning of this?

11:08.130 --> 11:10.500
The reason is probably...

11:09.380 --> 11:09.420
Beauty Salon

11:09.380 --> 11:09.420
PRINCE

11:27.560 --> 11:29.150
Shouma-kun.

11:29.150 --> 11:30.360
Wait, Kyouko!

11:30.940 --> 11:33.320
No! I definitely won't!

11:33.320 --> 11:34.530
What the hell?!

11:34.780 --> 11:37.320
Kyouko, you're my partner!

11:37.320 --> 11:40.030
Why do you hate the
battle suit I thought up for you?!

11:40.580 --> 11:43.120
How the hell is this a battle suit?!

11:43.120 --> 11:44.040
Just look at it.

11:45.200 --> 11:47.290
You're so lucky, Kyouko-san.

11:47.830 --> 11:49.000
Kiriko-chan.

11:50.210 --> 11:51.920
Your boyfriend is back.

11:51.920 --> 11:53.800
B-B-B-Boyfriend?!

11:54.050 --> 11:55.260
Don't get the wrong idea!

11:55.260 --> 11:57.630
We don't have that kind of relationship.

11:57.630 --> 12:00.140
Who cares? Kyouko, just give it a chance!

12:00.140 --> 12:03.260
Goodness. I'm only going to try it on.

12:03.260 --> 12:05.270
Yeah! That's how it's gotta be!

12:05.270 --> 12:06.850
See you later, Kiriko-chan.

12:06.850 --> 12:07.810
Y-Yes.

12:08.060 --> 12:11.020
I'm only going to try it on, okay?
I'm not going to do anything else!

12:11.020 --> 12:12.650
But then it won't be training!

12:12.650 --> 12:14.530
Why? That's not what you said a second ago!

12:13.860 --> 12:15.650
Just what kind of relationship do they have?

12:14.530 --> 12:16.320
You have to try it on and let me fondle you.

12:17.200 --> 12:21.120
The new Daimidaler with
a candle on its head.

12:21.570 --> 12:23.120
As I thought, he...

12:23.120 --> 12:24.910
Don't worry, Your Highness.

12:25.910 --> 12:27.120
Ritz.

12:27.120 --> 12:29.330
We will definitely defeat him next time.

12:29.710 --> 12:33.090
We've mastered the use of
the Hi-ERO particle generator.

12:33.670 --> 12:36.260
The Hi-ERO particle generator.

12:36.260 --> 12:43.350
Mankind's idea to turn Hi-ERO particles into a collectible battle force is impressive.

12:43.640 --> 12:49.980
But in the end, Daimidaler is merely a copy based on the technology of the Penguin Empire.

12:49.980 --> 12:54.020
With Ritz and the power of the
Hi-ERO particles we've accumulated,

12:54.020 --> 12:56.070
they are hardly an opponent to be feared.

12:56.070 --> 12:58.820
Right? The real fight begins now.

12:58.820 --> 13:03.490
But originally, Hi-ERO particles weren't
something to use for weaponry and warfare.

13:03.700 --> 13:04.660
Huh?

13:05.280 --> 13:08.910
Ritz. I've done something terribly wrong.

13:12.330 --> 13:15.750
I wonder what His
Highness was trying to say?

13:15.750 --> 13:18.840
What's wrong, Ritz?
Making a face like that!

13:18.840 --> 13:19.920
Oh, Michael.

13:20.300 --> 13:24.640
Listen, His Highness said that he
had done something terribly wrong.

13:24.640 --> 13:25.930
His Highness did?!

13:27.720 --> 13:28.930
What do you think he meant?

13:29.850 --> 13:31.690
Huh? Michael...

13:32.480 --> 13:36.650
Well, it's fine. Either way,
we will defeat Daimidaler.

13:36.650 --> 13:37.690
That's all there is to it!

13:38.230 --> 13:39.650
T-T-T-T-Terrible news!

13:39.860 --> 13:42.610
Michael, what has you so flustered?

13:42.610 --> 13:46.030
His Highness committed
a grave sin against Ritz!

13:46.030 --> 13:46.870
His Highness did?!

13:47.620 --> 13:48.790
What is it?

13:48.790 --> 13:52.080
It seems His Highness
raped Ritz and then apologized.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.670
That can't be forgiven
with just an apology!

13:53.670 --> 13:55.130
That's downright sexual harassment!

13:55.130 --> 13:56.290
His Highness did what?

13:56.290 --> 13:57.590
Sexual harassment?

13:57.590 --> 14:00.170
Committing sexual harassment
by raping and apologizing.

14:00.170 --> 14:02.050
What kind of fetish is that?

14:03.930 --> 14:06.220
Oh, like using a Gulliver stick?

14:06.220 --> 14:08.770
That's just your front tail, Shouma.

14:08.770 --> 14:12.600
Right, tail. Definitely
a tail. It can only be a tail.

14:12.600 --> 14:15.020
Yeah, y'all really got me there.

14:15.020 --> 14:17.230
You're such a Penguin gagster, Shouma.

14:20.320 --> 14:23.320
Is it true that we've found
the base of the Penguin Empire?

14:23.320 --> 14:26.160
Googled it and it came up in the search results.

14:26.570 --> 14:27.620
Why?

14:27.830 --> 14:31.330
Don't secret bases normally have
a device that hides them from radar

14:31.330 --> 14:34.790
or keeps them covered in
eternal clouds or something?

14:34.790 --> 14:36.420
It was a trick.

14:36.420 --> 14:39.090
Sonan-chan, those attack
clothes look really good on you.

14:39.090 --> 14:40.090
Huh?

14:40.090 --> 14:43.050
Eek! I forgot I was trying them on!

14:43.380 --> 14:44.800
Attack clothes...?

14:45.010 --> 14:47.510
No! It's a battle suit!

14:47.510 --> 14:48.510
Kyouko!

14:48.810 --> 14:51.520
Since you're wearing the
battle suit, let's practice!

14:51.770 --> 14:54.520
See, Kouichi-kun is
calling it a battle suit too.

14:54.520 --> 14:56.850
Huh? Practice?

14:58.060 --> 14:58.860
I'll borrow these!

14:58.860 --> 14:59.730
Wait!

14:59.980 --> 15:02.740
Oh, my. Already so many Hi-ERO particles.

15:00.400 --> 15:02.740
Everyone's watching!

15:02.740 --> 15:06.360
Hell, yeah! Be it Rikantz
Seaberry or Penguin robots,

15:06.360 --> 15:07.740
I definitely won't lose!

15:08.160 --> 15:11.490
Yes. Your determination
before battle is superb!

15:11.490 --> 15:14.750
It's not superb at all! Someone stop him!

15:16.210 --> 15:19.340
How scandalous! How depraved!

15:19.340 --> 15:21.800
This is real-time
video from a hidden camera.

15:21.800 --> 15:24.470
I can't stand watching
it any longer. That's enough.

15:24.760 --> 15:28.430
Well, then. Since the Minister
of Art is currently on a trip abroad,

15:28.430 --> 15:30.810
I, the assistant, will submit my report.

15:32.270 --> 15:40.020
The sale of unhealthy goods,
games, and videos have slowly increased.

15:40.020 --> 15:44.690
The amount of skin exposure in
recent anime has also recovered.

15:44.690 --> 15:47.570
This phenomenon has all
occurred in the last few weeks!

15:48.820 --> 15:51.580
It's like a virus causing an epidemic.

15:51.580 --> 15:55.330
It all began when this
type of Daimidaler appeared.

15:55.620 --> 15:57.370
Beauty Salon Prince.

15:57.920 --> 16:00.420
We should have wiped them out

16:00.420 --> 16:02.840
after the explosion in West Shinjuku.

16:03.090 --> 16:05.460
When the Penguin Empire appeared,

16:05.460 --> 16:09.340
I thought they would
be the saviors of this world.

16:09.550 --> 16:14.770
The saviors who purified this
world were the Penguin Empire, after all.

16:14.770 --> 16:16.430
What irony.

16:17.560 --> 16:20.610
I would like measures to be taken immediately to fix this.

16:21.110 --> 16:23.400
Before the people begin to cause a fuss.

16:26.860 --> 16:29.200
I-Isn't that enough?!

16:29.200 --> 16:30.360
Not yet!

16:30.360 --> 16:33.080
I'll show you some
interesting specs on this battle suit!

16:33.450 --> 16:35.830
Open top!

16:35.370 --> 16:37.210
S-Stupid!

16:35.830 --> 16:39.580
With this, I'll be able to easily fondle your naked boobs anytime!

16:41.960 --> 16:43.960
The Hi-ERO particles
have reached MAX level.

16:43.960 --> 16:44.750
Already?

16:44.750 --> 16:47.130
Yes. With this much power,

16:47.130 --> 16:50.010
we can devise a plan
with a good chance of success.

16:50.010 --> 16:51.260
Administrator!

16:51.260 --> 16:53.010
What is it, Kiyuna Kiriko?

16:53.550 --> 16:55.640
Please allow me to go as well!

16:57.600 --> 17:01.230
Two Daimidalers can only
increase our chances of winning!

17:01.230 --> 17:02.100
Very well!

17:02.100 --> 17:03.480
Thank you very much!

17:03.810 --> 17:06.320
I'll go check on Type-6!

17:06.730 --> 17:08.400
But, Administrator...

17:08.400 --> 17:12.820
To move Type-6 we need Ameku-kun
to regulate Kiyuna-chan's power.

17:12.820 --> 17:14.450
They have to make out.

17:14.450 --> 17:15.740
That's true.

17:15.740 --> 17:18.580
Kiyuna Kiriko may go berserk again.

17:18.580 --> 17:22.670
But it'd be great if we destroyed
them using that huge power.

17:22.670 --> 17:24.460
We'll be at the enemy's base, anyway.

17:24.460 --> 17:26.250
Going berserk would be great!

17:28.380 --> 17:30.420
Whoa...

17:31.550 --> 17:33.930
Kiriko-chan, so you're all right now.

17:34.260 --> 17:36.890
Thank goodness.
Let's work hard together.

17:36.890 --> 17:38.390
Yeah, let's do it.

17:38.390 --> 17:40.180
We'll need to think of a plan.

17:40.640 --> 17:41.690
Plan?

17:42.100 --> 17:43.810
First, I'll fondle your tits.

17:43.810 --> 17:44.730
No way!

17:45.480 --> 17:48.730
Then, I'll put you in full burst
mode and switch over to Type-Super.

17:48.730 --> 17:50.490
There, I'll grab Kyouko's ass.

17:50.490 --> 17:51.950
Why my butt?!

17:52.150 --> 17:54.530
If I only fondle boobs,
there isn't enough variety.

17:55.660 --> 17:57.330
That's enough!

17:58.490 --> 18:02.870
I'm an unusually high emitter
of particles, so I don't need help.

18:02.870 --> 18:05.960
I will go into full burst
using my own imagination.

18:06.460 --> 18:07.800
Imagination?

18:08.460 --> 18:10.590
F-Forget it!

18:10.590 --> 18:14.470
Either way, I will not allow anyone
other than Shouma-kun to touch my body!

18:15.010 --> 18:16.300
What the hell?

18:16.300 --> 18:20.100
She's making things so difficult
even though we'll be teaming up.

18:20.100 --> 18:21.480
Kiriko-chan?

18:24.270 --> 18:25.600
I'm sorry for all the trouble.

18:25.900 --> 18:28.110
Well, it's fine.

18:28.400 --> 18:31.110
It looks like Ameku Shouma
hasn't been coming to school lately.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.190
Huh?

18:32.190 --> 18:35.110
It's a problem for me
if even a single student fails.

18:35.410 --> 18:37.620
Th-That's...

18:38.160 --> 18:39.410
Hey!

18:39.740 --> 18:40.700
A Pen...

18:40.700 --> 18:41.660
Pen?

18:41.660 --> 18:45.210
Oh, no. Pentagon!
He's gone to the Pentagon to train.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.960
Oh? The Pentagon!

18:46.960 --> 18:50.920
So not only do you have ties
with Japan, but with America as well!

18:50.920 --> 18:52.550
Yes, that's how it is...

18:54.930 --> 18:56.300
Forget America,

18:56.300 --> 19:00.810
we seem to be on pretty bad terms
with even the Japanese government recently.

19:01.220 --> 19:02.890
Thank you very much.

19:02.890 --> 19:06.440
I was worried about my attendance since I had to stay home due to my injuries.

19:07.560 --> 19:10.900
I talked to Chieko-sensei
about this a while back.

19:10.900 --> 19:13.940
This way you guys
won't be held back a year.

19:14.400 --> 19:16.450
How troublesome.

19:18.570 --> 19:20.530
It's pretty peaceful.

19:20.530 --> 19:22.950
Yes. I don't see any people...

19:26.870 --> 19:28.330
Watch out!

19:31.210 --> 19:32.250
The hell?!

19:32.250 --> 19:33.090
Daimidaler!

19:35.670 --> 19:36.840
Why is Daimidaler here?

19:37.090 --> 19:39.510
Kyouko-san, the radio!
There might be some news.

19:39.510 --> 19:40.810
Y-Yes.

19:41.850 --> 19:45.270
Emergency evacuation of the Edogawa district has been announced.

19:45.270 --> 19:49.480
Please follow the directions of the police and evacuate calmly.

19:47.770 --> 19:49.480
Emergency Evacuation?

19:49.480 --> 19:53.110
I repeat. In a central building of the Edogawa district,

19:49.480 --> 19:50.860
What's going on?!

19:53.110 --> 19:57.490
an anti-socialist group called Beauty Salon Prince has armed and blockaded itself.

19:57.490 --> 20:00.870
An emergency evacuation
of the Edogawa district has been announced.

19:57.910 --> 19:59.490
Beauty Salon Prince...

19:59.490 --> 20:00.870
Is it talking about us?!

20:01.240 --> 20:03.450
What? What's going on?

20:04.080 --> 20:05.620
What the hell is going on?!

20:05.620 --> 20:10.040
I don't know. A unit of Daimidaler
Type-3 is heading this way.

20:10.040 --> 20:12.380
It looks like a Daimidaler army!

20:12.380 --> 20:14.960
The mass production type
that was left with the government!

20:14.960 --> 20:18.130
They said that they destroyed them,
but it looks like they made more instead!

20:18.510 --> 20:20.550
Looks like they made numerous copies.

20:20.550 --> 20:24.140
Normal people can pilot the Type-3
because it uses the plasma system.

20:24.350 --> 20:27.480
No wonder they kept refusing to return it.

20:27.480 --> 20:29.150
What is the meaning of this?!

20:33.150 --> 20:37.820
This message is for gang boss
Matayoshi Kazuo and his cohorts.

20:37.820 --> 20:39.240
Gang boss?!

20:39.240 --> 20:40.320
Cohorts?!

20:40.700 --> 20:44.830
This base has been surrounded.
Put down your weapons and surrender.

20:44.830 --> 20:45.830
Base...

20:45.830 --> 20:47.330
They're treating us
like some evil organization?

20:47.830 --> 20:53.540
With the help of the Penguin Empire, we have been able to quell the unhealthy actions of young men.

20:53.540 --> 20:59.010
However, your existence will
bring depravity back to this country!

21:00.130 --> 21:05.140
Idiots! Have you forgotten all
that the Penguin Empire has done?

21:05.430 --> 21:09.520
I'd like to ask the same question. Do you know how much money is spent on restoration

21:09.520 --> 21:11.190
every time that Daimidaler is used?

21:11.190 --> 21:14.610
Right now, all of you from Beauty
Salon Prince are our worst enemy!

21:14.610 --> 21:15.610
What?!

21:17.110 --> 21:19.950
It's embarrassing because we can't deny it.

21:20.400 --> 21:22.820
It looks like you don't have any intention to surrender.

21:22.820 --> 21:23.620
What?!

21:23.620 --> 21:25.620
That's really too bad.

21:25.620 --> 21:27.120
Why has it come to this?!

21:27.120 --> 21:29.500
Wait! We haven't responded yet!

21:29.500 --> 21:30.120
Stop.

21:30.500 --> 21:31.290
Administrator.

21:31.290 --> 21:37.960
They were planning on
eliminating us from the beginning.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.470
No way.

21:40.470 --> 21:41.970
Attack preparation complete!

21:46.430 --> 21:48.220
Commence attack!

21:58.480 --> 21:59.610
Leave it to us

21:59.070 --> 22:01.070
Love love li-li-links

22:00.650 --> 22:01.820
Yes!

22:01.950 --> 22:03.700
Prince

22:16.670 --> 22:21.300
Don't worry about the force of the stars

22:21.050 --> 22:25.550
Let's let our power out

22:25.340 --> 22:29.930
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

22:29.680 --> 22:33.730
When you want to meet someone

22:33.690 --> 22:36.440
Preparation okay!

22:35.900 --> 22:38.230
Let's go then!

22:38.020 --> 22:40.730
It'll work out somehow

22:40.190 --> 22:42.530
Let's go with that!

22:42.490 --> 22:46.700
When we have something amazing

22:46.660 --> 22:49.450
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:49.080 --> 22:51.290
Let's go, everyone

22:50.410 --> 22:51.540
Yes!

22:51.000 --> 22:55.500
Let's make our own happiness

22:55.330 --> 22:59.670
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:59.380 --> 23:04.260
You'll never be able to have it

23:04.260 --> 23:08.510
For a happy future, you have to be determined

23:08.260 --> 23:09.850
Love love link

23:09.350 --> 23:10.970
I want to be a bride

23:10.470 --> 23:12.140
Leave it to me

23:11.810 --> 23:15.690
Let's have fun around the world

23:27.360 --> 23:42.380
Next Episode

23:28.490 --> 23:30.740
Everyone goes on their own path.

23:31.080 --> 23:34.000
No matter where you go or how old
you become, it will never be forgotten.

23:34.000 --> 23:35.710
Front tails forever.

23:37.040 --> 23:40.670
Next episode: Showdown!
Sound Robots vs. Daimidaler"

23:38.880 --> 23:42.380
Showdown  !
Sound Robots V.S. Daimidaler

23:40.670 --> 23:42.340
Please look forward to it.

23:40.880 --> 23:42.880
Please watch.
